sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as Platform Admin
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant WVA as WVA Controller<br/>wva-system namespace
    participant Prom as Prometheus / Thanos<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant EPP as Gateway API EPP<br/>Pod port HTTP/HTTPS
    participant Cache as In-Memory Cache
    participant Metrics as /metrics<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
    participant HPA as HPA / KEDA
    participant Deploy as Inference Deployment

    Note over Admin,Deploy: Flow 1: Saturation-Based Autoscaling

    Admin->>K8s: Create HPA with llm-d.ai/managed=true
    K8s-->>WVA: HPA watch event
    WVA->>WVA: Track namespace, bootstrap ConfigMaps

    loop Every optimization interval
        WVA->>Prom: PromQL queries<br/>Bearer Token (SA token)<br/>KV cache, queue depth, TTFT, ITL
        Prom-->>WVA: Metric results
        WVA->>WVA: Route to analyzers<br/>(Saturation V2 / QM / Throughput)
        WVA->>WVA: Apply optimizer pipeline<br/>(CostAware or GreedyByScore)
        WVA->>WVA: Apply GPU limiter constraints
        WVA->>Cache: Store wva_desired_replicas
    end

    HPA->>Metrics: GET /metrics<br/>Bearer Token + authn/authz
    Metrics-->>HPA: wva_desired_replicas = N
    HPA->>K8s: PATCH scale subresource
    K8s->>Deploy: Scale to N replicas

    Note over Admin,Deploy: Flow 2: Scale-from-Zero

    loop Every 100ms
        WVA->>EPP: Scrape flow-control queue<br/>HTTP/HTTPS, Bearer Token (optional)
        EPP-->>WVA: Queue size / bytes
        alt Zero replicas AND pending requests
            WVA->>K8s: PATCH scale 0→1<br/>Bearer Token (SA token)
            K8s->>Deploy: Scale to 1 replica
            WVA->>Cache: Record scale-from-zero event
        end
    end

    Note over Admin,Deploy: Flow 3: GPU Rebalance (Coordinator)

    loop Every 15s (leader-elected)
        WVA->>Prom: Query flow-control queue metrics<br/>Bearer Token
        Prom-->>WVA: Queue depth per namespace
        WVA->>K8s: GET ResourceQuotas<br/>GPU capacity per namespace
        K8s-->>WVA: Quota values
        WVA->>WVA: Compute GPU rebalance
        WVA->>K8s: PATCH HPA/ScaledObject maxReplicas<br/>Bearer Token (SA token)
    end
